      "name": "dsh-radeon-capacity",
      "title": {
        "en": "Radeon Capacity",
        "zh": "Radeon 容量"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Shows AMD Radeon Cloud AI Capacity for every model: a per-model badge in the model picker, and the selected model's capacity on the same row as its name. Quota is display-only (AMD is currently free and unmetered). Optionally writes the provider config into the DSH user layer, so it keeps working after you uninstall this plugin.",
        "zh": "显示 AMD Radeon Cloud 的 AI Capacity：模型选择器里每个模型一枚容量徽章，当前模型的容量与模型名同一行展示。额度仅作展示（AMD 目前免费不限量）。可选一键把 provider 配置写进 DSH 用户层，卸载本插件后依然可用。"
      },
